claim.claim-text:
a substrate (2), comprising a first surface (11), a second surface (12) opposite to the first surface (11), and a plurality of side surfaces (13) adjacent to and between the first surface (11) and the second surface (12);
a doped conducting layer (3) and a first passivation layer (4), sequentially stacked on and only cover the first surface (11);
an anti-reflection layer (5), stacked on the first passivation layer (4), the anti-reflection layer (5) covering the first surface (11) to at least cover the first passivation layer (4);
a passivation contact layer (6), stacked on the second surface (12), the passivation contact layer (6) comprising a doped polysilicon conductive layer (62); and
a second passivation layer (7), stacked on the passivation contact layer (6), the second passivation layer (7) covering the second surface (12) to at least cover the passivation contact layer (6);
wherein the anti-reflection layer (5) further covers at least part of the plurality of side surfaces (13), and the anti-reflection layer (5) further covers at least part of the second surface (12), the at least part of the second surface (12) being adjacent to the plurality of side surfaces (13); a part of the anti-reflection layer (5) is stacked on the passivation contact layer (6); the second passivation layer (7) covers at least part of the anti-reflection layer (5), and a part of the second passivation layer (7) is stacked on the anti-reflection layer (5).

providing a panel (10), the panel (10) comprising a substrate (2), a doped conducting layer (3), a first passivation layer (4), and a passivation contact layer (6), the substrate (2) comprising a first surface (11), a second surface (12) opposite to the first surface (11), and a plurality of side surfaces (13) adjacent to and between the first surface (11) and the second surface (12), the doped conducting layer (3) and the first passivation layer (4) being sequentially stacked on and only covering the first surface (11), and the passivation contact layer (6) being stacked on the second surface (12) and comprising a doped polysilicon conductive layer (62);
forming an anti-reflection layer (5) on the first passivation layer (4), the anti-reflection layer (5) covering the first surface (11) to at least cover the first passivation layer (4);
forming a second passivation layer (7) on the passivation contact layer (6), the second passivation layer (7) covering the second surface (12) to completely cover the passivation contact layer (6);
wherein the anti-reflection layer (5) further covers at least part of the plurality of side surfaces (13), and the anti-reflection layer (5) further covers at least part of the second surface (12), the at least part of the second surface (12) being adjacent to the plurality of side surfaces (13); a part of the anti-reflection layer (5) is stacked on the passivation contact layer (6); the second passivation layer (7) covers at least part of the anti-reflection layer (5), and a part of the second passivation layer (7) is stacked on the anti-reflection layer (5).

forming the doped conducting layer (3) on the first surface (11) of the substrate (2);
forming the passivation contact layer (6) on the second surface of the substrate (2); and
forming the first passivation layer (4) on the doped conducting layer (3).
